---
import Html from "../../layouts/Html.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/navbar/Navbar.svelte";
import MainContainer from "../../components/MainContainer.astro";
import FeaturePageHero from "../../components/features/FeaturePageHero.astro";
import HeroContent from "../../components/hero/HeroContent.astro";
import HeroIframe from "../../components/hero/HeroIframe.astro";
import ResponsivePadding from "../../components/ResponsivePadding.astro";
import HomeSecHeading from "../../components/home/HomeSecHeading.astro";
import HomeSecParagraph from "../../components/home/HomeSecParagraph.astro";
import HomeSecTriFeature from "../../components/home/HomeSecTriFeature.astro";
import HomeSecTriFeatureItem from "../../components/home/HomeSecTriFeatureItem.astro";
import RowCustomisation from "../../components/home/reusable/RowCustomisation.astro";
import RowConfiguration from "../../components/home/reusable/RowConfiguration.astro";
import HomeSecComparisonTable from "../../components/home/comparisonTable/HomeSecComparisonTable.astro";
import PricingSection from "../../components/pricing/PricingSection.astro";
import HomeSecContact from "../../components/home/reusable/HomeSecContact.astro";
---

<Html
    title="End-to-end encrypted forms for your healthcare practice"
    description="Build secure intake forms your patients can trust in just a few minutes with Palform. Get secure end-to-end encryption and simplified GDPR compliance, along with beautiful designs and a user-friendly interface."
>
    <Navbar />

    <MainContainer>
        <FeaturePageHero
            title="Secure intake forms your patients can trust"
            description="Build end-to-end encrypted intake and assessment forms in minutes, and give client data the protection it needs. Nobody can read stored response data; not even us."
        >
            <HeroContent class="relative md:flex hidden">
                <HeroIframe url="https://pf.palform.app/home-page-healthcare" />
            </HeroContent>
        </FeaturePageHero>

        <ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
            <HomeSecHeading size="big">
                Your patients deserve privacy
            </HomeSecHeading>
            <HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
                When you're processing sensitive medical information that's
                considered a special category of personal data by the GDPR,
                ensuring you have appropriate safeguards and security measures
                is essential. The law requires it, and your patients expect it.
                Palform lets you provide a level of security above the industry
                standard with end-to-end encryption on all responses.
            </HomeSecParagraph>

            <HomeSecTriFeature class="mt-16">
                <HomeSecTriFeatureItem
                    title="Simplified GDPR compliance"
                    icon="fa6-solid:section"
                    link="https://docs.palform.app/orgs/agreements/"
                >
                    Use our handy data retention tools and self-service Data
                    Processing Agreement to ensure thorough compliance with the
                    GDPR and other data protection laws.
                </HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
                <HomeSecTriFeatureItem
                    title="Reduced data breach risk"
                    icon="fa6-solid:shield-halved"
                    link="https://docs.palform.app/keys/technical"
                >
                    Only you and the colleagues you choose can read your
                    clients' answers. We can't, and neither could anyone who
                    breached our servers.
                </HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
                <HomeSecTriFeatureItem
                    title="Multi-user permission system"
                    icon="fa6-solid:sitemap"
                    link="https://docs.palform.app/orgs/teams"
                >
                    Configure hierarchical access to data and use audit logging
                    for a multi-layered security approach.
                </HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
            </HomeSecTriFeature>
        </ResponsivePadding>

        <ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
            <HomeSecHeading size="big">
                Perfect for medical clinics and therapists
            </HomeSecHeading>
            <HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
                Palform makes it easy to build secure, reliable client intake
                and assessment forms, pre-session questionnaires, consent forms,
                and more. Not only will your patients love the user experience,
                they'll also be reassured by the strong security and privacy
                guarantees. This fosters an environment of strong patient trust,
                helping you build a long-term relationship with your clients.
            </HomeSecParagraph>
            <HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
                Collect only the data you need, store it encrypted on our
                servers, set your own retention period, and self-sign a DPA in
                just a few minutes. While GDPR compliance is ultimately your
                responsibility, we do everything to make our side of it as
                smooth and easy as possible.
            </HomeSecParagraph>
            <HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
                Our servers are hosted in Germany, an EU member state. If you're
                in the UK, the UK-EU adequacy decision makes it painless for
                your client data to be processed on our infrastructure.
            </HomeSecParagraph>

            <HomeSecTriFeature class="mt-16">
                <HomeSecTriFeatureItem
                    title="Fully anonymous"
                    icon="fa6-solid:mask"
                >
                    Absolutely zero tracking, ads, or analytics in your form
                    fill pages. Gain stronger trust and avoid breaches.
                </HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
                <HomeSecTriFeatureItem
                    title="Easy link sharing"
                    icon="fa6-solid:qrcode"
                    link="https://docs.palform.app/forms/publishing/"
                >
                    Generate a QR code or a powerful short link in just 2
                    clicks, making your branding super powerful.
                </HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
                <HomeSecTriFeatureItem
                    title="Versatile question types"
                    icon="fa6-solid:gear"
                    link="https://docs.palform.app/forms/questions/#question-types"
                >
                    E-signatures, address search, secure file uploads, and more:
                    all for no extra charge.
                </HomeSecTriFeatureItem>
            </HomeSecTriFeature>
        </ResponsivePadding>

        <ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
            <HomeSecHeading size="big">Secure ≠ ugly</HomeSecHeading>
            <HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
                Our ultra-high security standards don't mean the user experience
                is any worse. In fact, Palform lets you build beautiful, highly
                customisable forms that fit your branding perfectly. You can get
                started in a few clicks and share your first form in just a few
                minutes. The encryption runs in the background, with as little
                input needed from you as possible.
            </HomeSecParagraph>
        </ResponsivePadding>

        <RowCustomisation class="mt-20" />
        <RowConfiguration class="mt-20" />

        <ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
            <HomeSecHeading size="big"> Save time and costs </HomeSecHeading>
            <HomeSecParagraph class="mt-4">
                Palform is not only more secure than competitors, it's also much
                cheaper. With unlimited responses included for free (forever!),
                you'll never have to stress about limits and quotas again.
                Upgrade to our fairly-priced plans for more advanced features
                and brand customisation.
            </HomeSecParagraph>
            <HomeSecComparisonTable class="mt-8" />
        </ResponsivePadding>

        <ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
            <PricingSection />
        </ResponsivePadding>

        <ResponsivePadding class="mt-32">
            <HomeSecContact />
        </ResponsivePadding>
    </MainContainer>
</Html>
